<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S5.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In 5 Alternatives to Effective Rank ‣ Disentangling Geometry, Performance, and Training in Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Representation geometry varies less than the unembedding geometry.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
